        "original_id": "7d470f56-a8b7-55d9-9a72-0da64bf6274e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Pledis Entertainment\n- People: Han Sung-soo, Son Dam-bi, Kahi, JR, Baekho, Yoo Ara, Lime, Park Jung-hyun\n- Groups: After School, Orange Caramel, NU'EST, Seventeen, Pristin, Hello Venus\n- Products: Happy Pledis 2nd Album\n- Concepts: K-pop sub-units\n\nFacts:\n- Pledis Entertainment is a South Korean record label and entertainment agency founded in 2007 by Han Sung-soo.\n- Pledis Entertainment is home to K-pop artists After School, Orange Caramel, NU'EST, Han Dong Geun, Kye Bumzu, Seventeen, and Pristin.\n- Seventeen consists of thirteen members divided into three specialized sub-units called the Hip-Hop Unit, Vocal Unit, and Performance Unit.\n- Happy Pledis 2nd Album is a charity single by Pledis Entertainment artists Son Dam-bi, Kahi, After School, NU'EST members JR and Baekho, Hello Venus members Yoo Ara and Lime, and Pre-School Girl Park Jung-hyun.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
